# Yarn Berry PnP
# Note: .yarn/cache/ contains large files (>100MB) that exceed GitHub's limits
# Keeping .pnp.cjs for faster dependency resolution, but cache excluded
# CI/CD will need to run 'yarn install' but will benefit from Yarn's cache
.pnp.*
.yarn/cache/
.yarn/unplugged/
.yarn/build-state.yml
.yarn/install-state.gz

